  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>퀴즈</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 057</p><h1>퀴즈</h1></div><strong>57 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"57번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:53%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q057\" data-question=\"Q057\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q057</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An Aurora application must separate read queries from its writer and distribute them across replicas. Which endpoint should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q057\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the writer endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q057\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway Elastic IP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q057\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The reader endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q057\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume ID</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">Aurora</a>의 reader endpoint는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">읽기 복제본</a>으로 연결을 분산한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">Aurora</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q056/\">이전 문제 <b>Q056</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q058/\">다음 문제 <b>Q058</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
